nally made it! I did not think that you would have it in you ... However: are you ready for another assignment?"}]},{"say":"yes","reply":"For your noble deeds I grant you the title Assistant Postofficer. All Postofficers will charge you less money from now on. After every second mission ask me for an ADVANCEMENT. Your next task will be a bit more challenging. Do you feel ready for it?","fx":["quest 250 becomes 1","quest 249 becomes 1"],"alts":[{"other":true,"reply":"Too bad, perhaps another time then."}]},{"say":"yes","reply":"I need you to deliver a bill to the stage magician David Brassacres. He''s hiding from his creditors somewhere in Venore. It''s likely you will have to trick him somehow to reveal his identity. Report back when you delivered this bill.","fx":["you get bill","quest 229 becomes 1"],"alts":[{"other":true,"reply":"Too bad, perhaps another time then."}]},{"say":"bye","reply":"Good bye.","fx":["ends the conversation"]}]'::jsonb, text = 'Back to Kevin: report the mailbox fixed. He makes you an Assistant Postofficer (cheaper parcels and letters) and gives you Mission 3: deliver a bill to the stage magician David Brassacres, who hides from his creditors in Venore.' where id = 815;
update public.map_quest_steps set dialog = '[{"say":"hi","reply":"Uh? What do you want?!"},{"say":"hat","reply":"What? My hat?? Theres... nothing special about it!","cond":["quest 229 is 1"],"alts":[{"reply":"Get lost!","fx":["ends the conversation"]}]},{"say":"hat","reply":"Stop bugging me about that hat, do you listen?"},{"say":"hat","reply":"Hey! Don''t touch that hat! Leave it alone!!! Don''t do this!!!!"},{"say":"hat","reply":"Noooooo! Argh, ok, ok, I guess I can''t deny it anymore, I am David Brassacres, the magnificent, so what do you want?","fx":["summons a rabbit","summons a rabbit","summons a rabbit","summons a rabbit","quest 229 becomes 2"]},{"say":"bill","reply":"A bill? Oh boy so you are delivering another bill to poor me?","cond":["quest 229 is 2"],"alts":[{"reply":"Thats not my concern, you are probably looking for someone else and now get lost!","fx":["ends the conversation"]}]},{"say":"yes","reply":"Ok, ok, I''ll take it. I guess I have no other choice anyways. And now leave me alone in my misery please.","fx":["takes bill","quest 229 becomes 3"],"cond":["if you have bill"],"alts":[{"cond":["if you don''t have bill"],"reply":"Ha Ha! You have none!! Naanaanaanaaanaaaa!","fx":["ends the conversation"]},{"other":true,"reply":"Hoooraaaay! Uhm... I mean, thats fine..."}]}]'::jsonb where id = 817;
