ral postofficers. Please report back when you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 234 is 7"],"reply":"Once more you have impressed me! Are you willing to do another job?"},{"cond":["quest 233 above 0","quest 233 below 10"],"reply":"You are not done with your current mission. Make sure Hugo chief is tailoring our new uniforms. Please report back when you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 233 is 10"],"reply":"Excellent! Another job well done! Would you accept another mission?","fx":["quest 249 becomes 3"]},{"cond":["quest 231 is 1"],"reply":"You are not done with your current mission. Deliver that present to Fibula. Please report back when you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 230 is 1"],"reply":"Do you bring ONE bone for our officers'' safety fund or ALL bones at once?"},{"cond":["quest 230 above 1","quest 230 below 20"],"reply":"Do you bring a bone for our officers'' safety fund?"},{"cond":["quest 230 above 1","quest 230 is 20"],"reply":"Do you bring a bone for our officers'' safety fund?"},{"cond":["quest 230 above 20"],"reply":"You have made it! We have enough bones for the fund! You remind me of myself when I was young! Interested in another mission?"},{"cond":["quest 229 above 0","quest 229 below 3"],"reply":"You are not done with your current mission. Find David Brassacres and hand him that bill. Report when you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 229 is 3"],"reply":"You truly got him? Quite impressive. You are a very prommising candidate! I think I have another mission for you. Are you interested?"},{"cond":["quest 228 is 1"],"reply":"You are not done with your current mission. The mailbox is still not fixed. Report if you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 228 is 2"],"reply":"Excellent, you got it fixed! This will teach this mailbox a lesson indeed! Are you interested in another assignment?"},{"cond":["quest 227 below 5"],"reply":"You are not done with your current mission. Make sure all the passages are secure. Report if you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 227 is 5"],"reply":"So you have finally made it! I did not think that you would have it in you ... However: are you ready for another assignment?"}]},{"say":"yes","reply":"Ok. We need a new set of uniforms, and only the best will do for us. Please travel to Venore and negotiate with Hugo Chief a contract for new uniforms.","fx":["quest 233 becomes 1"],"alts":[{"other":true,"reply":"Too bad, perhaps another time then."}]}]'::jsonb where id = 824;
update public.map_quest_steps set dialog = '[{"say":"hi","reply":"Be greeted, <your name>!"},{"say":"uniform","reply":"A new uniform for the post officers? I am sorry but my dog ate the last dress pattern we used. You need to supply us with a new dress pattern.","cond":["quest 233 is 1"],"alts":[{"reply":"I don''t get it, what uniforms you are talking about."}]},{"say":"dress pattern","reply":"It was ... wonderous beyond wildest imaginations! I have no clue where Kevin Postner got it from. Better ask him.","fx":["quest 233 becomes 2"],"cond":["quest 233 is 1"],"alts":[{"cond":["quest 233 above 1","quest 233 below 9"],"reply":"I already told you to ask your boss about that issue."},{"cond":["quest 233 is 9"],"reply":"By the gods of fashion! Didn''t it do that I fed the last dress pattern to my poor dog? Will this mocking of all which is taste and fashion never stop?? Ok, ok, you will get those ugly, stinking uniforms and now get lost, fashion terrorist.","fx":["quest 233 becomes 10","ends the conversation"]}]}]'::jsonb where id = 825;
update public.map_quest_steps set dialog = '[{"say":"hi","reply":"Greetings <your name>, what brings you here?"},{"say":"dress pattern","reply":"Oh yes, where did we get that from ...? Let''s see, first ask the great technomancer in Kazordoon for the technical details. Return here afterwards.","fx":["quest 233 becomes 3"],"cond":["quest 233 is 2"],"alts":[{"cond":["quest 233 is 8"],"reply":"Fine, fine. I think that should do it. Tell Hugo that we order those uniforms. The completed dress pattern will soon arrive in Venore. Report to me when you have talked to him.","fx":["quest 233 becomes 9"]},{"reply":"The queen has sent me the samples we needed. The next part is tricky. We need the uniforms to emanate some odor that dogs hate.The dog with the best ''taste'' in that field is Noodles, the dog of King Tibianus. Do you understand so far?"},{"cond":["quest 233 is 4"],"reply":"The mail with Talphion''s instructions just arrived. I remember we asked Queen Eloise of Carlin for the perfect colours. Go there, ask her about the UNIFORMS and report back here.","fx":["quest 233 becomes 5"]}]}]'::jsonb where id = 826;
update public.map_quest_steps set dialog = '[{"say":"hi","reply":"HIHOOOO <your name>! <waves his hands>"},{"say":"dress pattern","reply":"DRESS FLATTEN? WHO WANTS ME TO FLATTEN A DRESS?","cond":["quest 233 is 3"],"alts":[{"cond":["quest 233 not 3"],"reply":"DRESS FLATTEN? WHO WANTS ME TO FLATTEN A DRESS?"}]},{"say":"dress pattern","reply":"A PRESS LANTERN? NEVER HEARD ABOUT IT!"},{"say":"dress pattern","reply":"CHESS? I DONT PLAY CHESS!"},{"say":"dress pattern","reply":"A PATTERN IN THIS MESS?? HEY DON''T INSULT MY MACHINEHALL!"},{"say":"dress pattern","reply":"AH YES! I WORKED ON THE DRESS PATTERN FOR THOSE UNIFORMS. STAINLESS TROUSERS, STEAM DRIVEN BOOTS! ANOTHER MARVEL TO BEHOLD! I''LL SEND A COPY TO KEVIN IMEDIATELY!","fx":["quest 233 becomes 4"]}]'::jsonb where id = 827;
update public.map_quest_steps set dialog = '[{"say":"hi","reply":"Greetings <your name>, what brings you here?"},{"say":"dress pattern","reply":"The mail with Talphion''s instructions just arrived. I remember we asked Queen Eloise of Carlin for the perfect colours. Go there, ask her about the UNIFORMS and report back here.","fx":["quest 233 becomes 5"],"cond":["quest 233 is 4"],"alts":[{"cond":["quest 233 is 8"],"reply":"Fine, fine. I think that should do it. Tell Hugo that we order those uniforms. The completed dress pattern will soon arrive in Venore. Report to me when you have talked to him.","fx":["quest 233 becomes 9"]},{"reply":"The queen has sent me the samples we needed. The next part is tricky. We need the uniforms to emanate some odor that dogs hate.The dog with the best ''taste'' in that field is Noodles, the dog of King Tibianus. Do you understand so far?"},{"cond":["quest 233 is 2"],"reply":"Oh yes, where did we get that from ...? Let''s see, first ask the great technomancer in Kazordoon for the technical details. Return here afterwards.","fx":["quest 233 becomes 3"]}]}]'::jsonb where id = 828;
update public.map_quest_steps set dialog = '[{"say":"hail queen","reply":"I greet thee, my loyal subject."},{"say":"uniform","reply":"I remember about those uniforms, they had a camouflage inlay so they could be worn the inside out too. I will send some colorsamples via mail to Mr. Postner.","fx":["quest 233 becomes 6"],"cond":["quest 233 is 5"],"alts":[{"reply":"The uniforms of our guards and soldiers are of unparraleled quality of course."}]}]'::jsonb where id = 829;
update public.map_quest_steps set dialog = '[{"say":"hi","reply":"Greetings <your name>, what brings you here?"},{"say":"dress pattern","reply":"The queen has sent me the samples we needed. The next part is tricky. We need the uniforms to emanate some odor that dogs hate.The dog with the best ''taste'' in that field is Noodles, the dog of King Tibianus. Do you understand so far?","cond":["quest 233 is 6"],"alts":[{"cond":["quest 233 is 8"],"reply":"Fine, fine. I think that should do it. Tell Hugo that we order those uniforms. The completed dress pattern will soon arrive in Venore. Report to me when you have talked to him.","fx":["quest 233 becomes 9"]},{"cond":["quest 233 is 2"],"reply":"Oh yes, where did we get that from ...? Let''s see, first ask the great technomancer in Kazordoon for the technical details. Return here afterwards.","fx":["quest 233 becomes 3"]},{"cond":["quest 233 is 4"],"reply":"The mail with Talphion''s instructions just arrived. I remember we asked Queen Eloise of Carlin for the perfect colours. Go there, ask her about the UNIFORMS and report back here.","fx":["quest 233 becomes 5"]}]},{"say":"yes","reply":"Good. Go there and find out what taste he dislikes most: moldy cheese, a piece of fur or a bananaskin. Tell him to SNIFF, then the object. Show him the object and ask ''Do you like that?''. DONT let the guards know what you are doing.","fx":["quest 233 becomes 7","quest 251 becomes Amount"],"alts":[{"other":true,"reply":"Too bad, perhaps you can try doing it some other time then."}]}]'::jsonb where id = 830;
update public.map_quest_steps set dialog = '[{"say":"hi","reply":"<sniff> Woof! <sniff>"},{"say":"sniff banana skin","reply":"<sniff> <sniff>","cond":["quest 233 is 7","quest 251 is 1"],"alts":[{"cond":["quest 233 not 7"],"reply":"Woof!","fx":["ends the conversation"]},{"cond":["quest 233 is 7","quest 251 is 2"],"reply":"<sniff> <sniff>"},{"cond":["quest 233 is 7","quest 251 is 3"],"reply":"<sniff> <sniff>"}]},{"say":"do you like that","reply":"Woof!","cond":["if you have banana skin"]},{"say":"sniff dirty fur","reply":"<sniff> <sniff>","cond":["quest 233 is 7","quest 251 is 1"],"alts":[{"cond":["quest 233 not 7"],"reply":"Woof!","fx":["ends the conversation"]},{"cond":["quest 233 is 7","quest 251 is 2"],"reply":"<sniff> <sniff>"},{"cond":["quest 233 is 7","quest 251 is 3"],"reply":"<sniff> <sniff>"}]},{"say":"do you like that","reply":"Woof!","cond":["if you have dirty fur"]},{"say":"sniff moldy cheese","reply":"<sniff> <sniff>","cond":["quest 233 is 7","quest 251 is 1"],"alts":[{"cond":["quest 233 not 7"],"reply":"Woof!","fx":["ends the conversation"]},{"cond":["quest 233 is 7","quest 251 is 2"],"reply":"<sniff> <sniff>"},{"cond":["quest 233 is 7","quest 251 is 3"],"reply":"<sniff> <sniff>"}]},{"say":"do you like that","reply":"Meeep! Grrrrr! <spits>","fx":["quest 233 becomes 8","ends the conversation"],"cond":["if you have moldy cheese"]}]'::jsonb, text = 'In Thais castle, tell Noodles to sniff each one and ask "do you like that?" until he spits. Which smell he hates differs per character: once he spits you are done (he ends the conversation).' where id = 832;
