nally made it! I did not think that you would have it in you ... However: are you ready for another assignment?"}]},{"say":"yes","reply":"Good, so listen. Hugo Chief informed me that he needs the measurements of our postofficers. Go and bring me the measurements of Ben, Lokur, Dove, Liane, Chrystal and Olrik.","fx":["quest 234 becomes 1"],"alts":[{"cond":["quest 250 < quest 249"],"reply":"Your eagerness is a virtue, young one, but first let''s talk about advancement."},{"other":true,"reply":"Too bad, perhaps another time then."}]}]'::jsonb where id = 836;
update public.map_quest_steps set dialog = '[{"say":"hi","reply":"Hello. How may I help you <your name>?"},{"say":"measurements","reply":"Oh they dont change that much since in the old days as... <tells a boring and confusing story about a cake, a parcel, himself and two squirrels, at least he tells you his measurements in the end>","fx":["quest 234 becomes quest 234+1","quest 236 becomes 1"],"cond":["quest 234 above 0","quest 236 below 1"]}]'::jsonb where id = 837;
update public.map_quest_steps set dialog = '[{"say":"hi","reply":"Hello <your name>. May I help you?"},{"say":"measurements","reply":"I have more urgent problem to attend then that. Those hawks are hunting my carrier pigeons. Bring me 12 arrows and I''ll see if I have the time for this nonsense. Do you have 12 arrows with you?","cond":["quest 234 above 0","quest 239 below 1"]},{"say":"yes","reply":"Great! Now I''ll teach them a lesson ... For those measurements ... <tells you her measurements>","fx":["takes 12 arrows","quest 234 becomes quest 234+1","quest 239 becomes 1"],"cond":["if you have 12 arrows"],"alts":[{"reply":"Fool, you have no 12 arrows."},{"other":true,"reply":"Don''t waste my time."}]}]'::jsonb where id = 838;
update public.map_quest_steps set dialog = '[{"say":"hi","reply":"Greetings, <your name>.","cond":["male characters only"],"alts":[{"cond":["female characters only"],"reply":"Greetings, <your name>. May I help you?"}]},{"say":"measurements","reply":"My measurements? Listen, lets make that a bit more exciting ... No, no, not what you think! I mean let''s gamble. I will roll a dice. If I roll a 6 you win and I''ll tell you what you need to know, else I win and get 5 gold. Deal?","cond":["quest 234 above 0","quest 240 below 1"]},{"say":"yes","reply":"Ok, here we go ... 6! You have won! How lucky you are! So listen ...<tells you what you need to know>","fx":["quest 234 becomes quest 234+1","quest 240 becomes 1"],"cond":["if you have 5 gp","random answer 6 (the NPC picks one)"],"alts":[{"other":true,"cond":["if you have 5 gp"],"reply":"Ok, and its ... <amount>! You have lost. He he. Another game?","fx":["takes 5 gp"]},{"other":true,"cond":["if you don''t have 5 gp"],"reply":"I am sorry, but you don''t have so much money."}]}]'::jsonb where id = 839;
update public.map_quest_steps set dialog = '[{"say":"hi","reply":"Hiho <your name>. May I help you?"},{"say":"measurements","reply":"Come on, I have no clue what they are. Better ask my armorer Kroox for such nonsense. Go and ask him for good ol'' Lokurs measurements, he''ll know.","fx":["quest 235 becomes 1"],"cond":["quest 234 above 0"],"alts":[{"cond":["quest 235 above 0"],"reply":"Ask Kroox about that stuff."}]}]'::jsonb where id = 840;
update public.map_quest_steps set dialog = '[{"say":"hi","reply":"Welcome to Kroox Quality Armor, <your name>!"},{"say":"lokurs measurements","reply":"Hm, well I guess its ok to tell you ... <tells you about Lokurs measurements>","fx":["quest 234 becomes quest 234+1","quest 237 becomes 1"],"cond":["quest 235 above 0","quest 237 below 1"],"alts":[{"reply":"UH? No clue what you are talking about, jawoll."}]}]'::jsonb where id = 841;
update public.map_quest_steps set dialog = '[{"say":"hi","reply":"At your service <your name>."},{"say":"measurements","reply":"If its necessary ... <tells you her measurements>","fx":["quest 234 becomes quest 234+1","quest 241 becomes 1"],"cond":["quest 234 above 0","quest 241 below 1"]}]'::jsonb where id = 842;
update public.map_quest_steps set dialog = '[{"say":"hi","reply":"Be greeted, noble <your name>."},{"say":"measurements","reply":"Oh no! I knew that day would come! I am slightly above the allowed weight and if you can''t supply me with some grapes to slim down I will get fired. Do you happen to have some grapes with you?","cond":["quest 234 above 0","quest 238 below 1"]},{"say":"yes","reply":"Oh thank you! Thank you so much! So listen ... <whispers her measurements>","fx":["takes grapes","quest 234 becomes quest 234+1","quest 238 becomes 1"],"cond":["if you have grapes"],"alts":[{"reply":"Don''t tease me! You don''t have any."},{"other":true,"reply":"Oh, no! I might loose my job."}]}]'::jsonb where id = 843;
