o another job?"},{"cond":["quest 233 above 0","quest 233 below 10"],"reply":"You are not done with your current mission. Make sure Hugo chief is tailoring our new uniforms. Please report back when you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 233 is 10"],"reply":"Excellent! Another job well done! Would you accept another mission?","fx":["quest 249 becomes 3"]},{"cond":["quest 231 is 1"],"reply":"You are not done with your current mission. Deliver that present to Fibula. Please report back when you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 231 is 2"],"reply":"Splendid, I knew we could trust you. I would like to ask for your help in another matter. Are you interested?"},{"cond":["quest 230 is 1"],"reply":"Do you bring ONE bone for our officers'' safety fund or ALL bones at once?"},{"cond":["quest 230 above 1","quest 230 below 20"],"reply":"Do you bring a bone for our officers'' safety fund?"},{"cond":["quest 230 above 1","quest 230 is 20"],"reply":"Do you bring a bone for our officers'' safety fund?"},{"cond":["quest 230 above 20"],"reply":"You have made it! We have enough bones for the fund! You remind me of myself when I was young! Interested in another mission?"},{"cond":["quest 229 above 0","quest 229 below 3"],"reply":"You are not done with your current mission. Find David Brassacres and hand him that bill. Report when you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 229 is 3"],"reply":"You truly got him? Quite impressive. You are a very prommising candidate! I think I have another mission for you. Are you interested?"},{"cond":["quest 228 is 1"],"reply":"You are not done with your current mission. The mailbox is still not fixed. Report if you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 228 is 2"],"reply":"Excellent, you got it fixed! This will teach this mailbox a lesson indeed! Are you interested in another assignment?"},{"cond":["quest 227 below 5"],"reply":"You are not done with your current mission. Make sure all the passages are secure. Report if you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 227 is 5"],"reply":"So you have finally made it! I did not think that you would have it in you ... However: are you ready for another assignment?"}]},{"say":"yes","reply":"Excellent. Here is a letter for you to deliver. Well, to be honest, no one else volunteered. It''s a letter from the mother of Markwin, the king of Mintwallin. Deliver that letter to him, but note that you will not be welcome there.","fx":["quest 245 becomes 1","you get letter to Markwin"],"alts":[{"other":true,"reply":"Too bad, perhaps another time then."}]}]'::jsonb where id = 852;
update public.map_quest_steps set dialog = '[{"say":"hi","reply":"No! The hornless have reached my city! BODYGUARDS TO ME!","fx":["quest 222 becomes 1","summons a minotaur guard","summons a minotaur guard","summons a minotaur mage","summons a minotaur mage","summons a minotaur archer","summons a minotaur archer","summons a minotaur archer","ends the conversation"],"cond":["quest 222 is 0"],"alts":[{"cond":["quest 245 is 2"],"reply":"Oh, it''s you again. What do you want, hornless messenger?"},{"reply":"Well ... you defeated my guards! Now everything is over! I guess I will have to answer your questions now."}]},{"say":"hi","reply":"Well ... you defeated my guards! Now everything is over! I guess I will have to answer your questions now.","alts":[{"cond":["quest 222 is 0"],"reply":"No! The hornless have reached my city! BODYGUARDS TO ME!","fx":["quest 222 becomes 1","summons a minotaur guard","summons a minotaur guard","summons a minotaur mage","summons a minotaur mage","summons a minotaur archer","summons a minotaur archer","summons a minotaur archer","ends the conversation"]},{"cond":["quest 245 is 2"],"reply":"Oh, it''s you again. What do you want, hornless messenger?"}]},{"say":"letter","reply":"A letter from my Moohmy?? Do you have a letter from my Moohmy to me?","cond":["quest 245 is 1"]},{"say":"yes","reply":"Uhm, well thank you, hornless beeing.","fx":["quest 245 becomes 2","takes letter to Markwin"],"cond":["if you have letter to Markwin"],"alts":[{"reply":"Don''t mock the king of the minotaurs or you will regret that!"},{"other":true,"reply":"Uh? What??"}]}]'::jsonb where id = 854;
