nally made it! I did not think that you would have it in you ... However: are you ready for another assignment?"}]},{"say":"advancement","reply":"You are worthy indeed. Do you want to advance in our guild?","cond":["quest 250 < quest 249"],"alts":[{"cond":["quest 250 >= quest 249"],"reply":"Sorry, but you are not yet ready for advancement."}]},{"say":"yes","reply":"I grant you the title of archpostman. You are a legend in our guild. As privilege of your newly aquired status you are allowed to make use of certain mailboxes in dangerous areas. Just look out for them and you''ll see.","fx":["quest 250 becomes 5"],"cond":["quest 249 is 5"],"alts":[{"cond":["quest 249 is 2"],"reply":"I grant you the title of postman. You are now a full member of our guild. Here have your own officers hat and wear it with pride.","fx":["quest 250 becomes 2","you get post officers hat"]},{"cond":["quest 249 is 3"],"reply":"From now on it shall be known that you are a grand postman. You are now a privileged member until the end of days. Most captains around the world have an agreement with our guild to transport our privileged members, like you, for less gold.","fx":["quest 250 becomes 3"]},{"cond":["quest 249 is 4"],"reply":"From now on you are a grand postman for special operations. You are an honoured member of our guild and earned the privilege of your own post horn. Here, take it.","fx":["quest 250 becomes 4","you get post horn"]}]},{"say":"bye","reply":"Good bye.","fx":["ends the conversation"]}]'::jsonb where id = 855;
